Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.39,0:00:45.24,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}来吧 出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:50.66,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}与你 一起编织 未来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.73,0:00:56.25,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}就算现在还在摸索 还在迷惘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.32,0:01:01.55,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\bord1\blur4\c&HA289EE&\3c&HFFFFFF&}描绘出 抛物线的光芒
